    "title": "【4K/碧蓝档案/动态壁纸】高度自定义 早濑优香  yuuka  千年学院管账婆  鼠标位移视差",
    "description": "[h2] 此壁纸介绍哔哩哔哩视频链接： [/h2]\r\n[url=https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gs421g7mL/?share_source=copy_web&vd_source=e098e4eb70436f3c33a2dce7903165f1] 【【碧蓝档案/动态壁纸】来自千年学院管账婆早濑优香的告白】 \r\n [/url]\r\n[h1] 《千年学院管账婆》 [/h1]\r\n[h2] 画师： [/h2][url=https://space.bilibili.com/17678040/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0] @三角函数不等式  [/url]\r\n\r\n[i] 可兼容显示器比例：16*9  16*10 [/i]\r\n\r\n自定义内容较多，可自行设置兼顾显示器的参数\r\n\r\n[h2] 自定义内容： [/h2]\r\n[h3] 1.人物动态功能组件 [/h3]（人物待机动作开关，人物动画开关，头发衣服飘动开关）\r\n[h3]  2.背景功能组件 [/h3] （背景物件动态效果开关，可导入自定义，导入图片比例只兼顾16*9）\r\n“导入自定义图片一定要勾选自定义背景开关，否则无法生效”\r\n[h3] 3.音频响应组件  [/h3]（4种可自行选择的音频响应模版，内含参数调整）\r\n[h3] 4.时间日期显示组件  [/h3]（可自行选择开关的时间日期显示组件，并且可自行拖动位置以符合你的口味）\r\n[h3] 5.视差位移组件  [/h3]（可调整鼠标视差的参数，以达到你想要的效果）\r\n[h3] 6.其他设置 [/h3] （镜头缩放，可以放大壁纸以达到你想要的效果）\r\n\r\n\r\n[u] 活动纹理储存为1543MB，如感到使用不畅，可以进入右上角设置中更改纹理分辨率为高性能，适当降低帧率，同时适当关闭部分选项。 [/u]\r\n\r\n[h1] 如果有什么很好的建议欢迎留言。 [/h1]\r\n\r\n[h1] 更新日志：[/h1]\r\n[h2] 5 月 30 日 下午 4:41: [/h2] [h3] 添加了背景音乐《Irasshaimase (NeLiME Remix)》，在用户属性将背景音乐大小调整至0就可以关闭背景音乐 [/h3]\r\n[h3] 添加了彩蛋，点击among us小人就能触发音效 [/h3]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[hr][/hr]\r\n\r\n\r\nThis wallpaper introduces video link：\r\n【【碧蓝档案/动态壁纸】来自千年学院管账婆早濑优香的告白】 https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gs421g7mL/?share_source=copy_web&vd_source=e098e4eb70436f3c33a2dce7903165f1\r\n\r\n《Yuuka》\r\nArtist：@三角函数不等式\r\n\r\nCompatible display ratio：16*9  16*10\r\n\r\nThere are many customizations, so you can set the parameters yourself to suit your monitor\r\n\r\nCustom Content：\r\n1.Character dynamic function components (character standby action switch, character animation switch, hair and clothes fluttering switch)\r\n2.Background function component (background object dynamic effect switch, can import pictures and videos, import picture ratio is only suitable for 16*9)\r\n\"Import custom picture must check the custom background switch, otherwise it will not take effect\"\r\n3.Audio response components (4 selectable audio response templates, including parameter adjustments)\r\n4.Time and date display component (you can choose the time and date display component on and off, and you can drag the position to suit your taste)\r\n5.Mouse parallax component (you can adjust the mouse parallax parameters to achieve the effect you want)\r\n6.Other Settings (lens zoom, you can zoom in on the wallpaper to get the look you want)\r\n\r\n\r\nThe active texture storage is 1543MB, if you feel that the use is not smooth, you can go to the upper right corner Settings to change the texture resolution to high performance, reduce the frame rate appropriately, and turn off some options appropriately.\r\n\r\nIf you have any good suggestions welcome to leave a message.",
